{"series":{"id":"apotheosis","slug":"apotheosis","title":"Apotheosis","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/apotheosis-3__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"también llamado aphoteosis, La novela habla principalmente de Luo Zheng, que cayó de la nube y se convirtió en un humilde esclavo de la familia. Se convirtió en un arma, la familia cayó y su hermana fue encarcelada por fuerzas poderosas. El destino de Luo Zheng fue arreglado por Dios. O el los llamados sin vida? ¿Cuánto durará la confrontación entre la raza humana, la raza demoníaca nocturna y la raza demoníaca? ¿Cuál es la fuerza misteriosa detrás de todo esto? El preludio de una lucha comenzó con una explosión.","genres":["Acción","Cultivo","Romance","Artes marciales","Aventura"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/apotheosis","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:28:33.820Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"apotheosis-1","slug":"apotheosis-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"apotheosis","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:29:41.509Z","episodeCount":52,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":52,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true},{"id":"apotheosis-3","slug":"apotheosis-3","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-3-1","image":null,"number":3,"seriesId":"apotheosis","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-3-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:29:09.618Z","episodeCount":26,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":26,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"apotheosis-1-1","slug":"apotheosis-1-1","title":"Apotheosis — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/apotheosis-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:29:10.150Z","seriesId":"apotheosis","seasonId":"apotheosis-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"apoth